'''Blissey ex''' (Japanese: '''ハピナス ex''' ''Happinas ex'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

